OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task

# Intrinsic stacking fault energy of FCC Al
# MEAM potential
# Normal-only atomic relaxation

clear
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic

variable a0 equal 4.04999918095267

# Oriented cell dimensions
variable lx equal v_a0*sqrt(6)/2*10
variable ly equal v_a0*sqrt(2)/2*10
variable lz equal v_a0*sqrt(3)*8

# FCC lattice: Z normal to {111}
lattice fcc ${a0} orient x 1 1 2 orient y -1 1 0 orient z -1 -1 1
lattice fcc 4.04999918095267 orient x 1 1 2 orient y -1 1 0 orient z -1 -1 1
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 6.613621 5.7275638 7.0148044

region box block 0 ${lx} 0 ${ly} 0 ${lz} units box
region box block 0 49.6021572601192 0 ${ly} 0 ${lz} units box
region box block 0 49.6021572601192 0 28.637818846516 0 ${lz} units box
region box block 0 49.6021572601192 0 28.637818846516 0 56.1184348161789 units box
create_box 1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (49.602157 28.637819 56.118435)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms 1 box
Created 5000 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 -0.0056118435) to (49.602157 28.637819 56.124047)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

mass 1 26.9815385

# MEAM potential
pair_style meam
pair_coeff * * library-Al.meam Al Al.meam Al

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe etotal press

# Define upper-half atoms
variable zcut equal v_lz/2-0.1
region upper block INF INF INF INF ${zcut} INF units box
region upper block INF INF INF INF 27.9592174080894 INF units box
group upper region upper
2600 atoms in group upper

# Allow relaxation only along Z
fix relax all setforce 0.0 0.0 NULL

min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-12 1.0e-10 10000 100000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 7
  ghost atom cutoff = 7
  binsize = 3.5, bins = 15 9 17
  2 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 2 0 0
  (1) pair meam, perpetual
      attributes: full, newton on
      pair build: full/bin/atomonly
      stencil: full/bin/3d
      bin: standard
  (2) pair meam, perpetual, half/full from (1)
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: halffull/newton
      stencil: none
      bin: none
